 15 percent. The race remains Republican-favored, though the recent tightening is worth monitoring through Election Day.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.1404, "margin": -5.31}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.2259, "margin": -4.8}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.1936, "margin": -5.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.1439, "margin": -6.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.1034, "margin": -6.5}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.0984, "margin": -7.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.1233, "margin": -7.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.1499, "margin": -6.2}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.142, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.1416, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.1411, "margin": -6.5}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.1652, "margin": -5.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.1661, "margin": -5.5}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.1363, "margin": -6.0}]}